input:
De vacaciones y sin ganas de cocinar, decidimos (x8) pedir pizzas en este lugar para retirar y comer en el lugar en el que nos estábamos hospedando, que quedaba a 500 metros. Así que, un jueves de verano, las fuimos a buscar cerca de las 21.30 horas.
Entramos y nos pareció muy ameno, limpio y confortable para comer ahí. Nos atendió un hombre muy amable y atento.
Pedimos los siguientes sabores:
- prosciutto (jamón crudo);
- ham (jamón cocido);
- pepperoni;
- cebolla;
- hongos;
- anchoas y
- albahaca y tomate.

Las pizzas tardaron 25/30 minutos. Todos sus gustos -de los cuales subo foto- estuvieron deliciosos. El estilo de pizza fue a la piedra, con salsa de tomate y queso muzzarela en una cantidad ideal.
Si bien este comentario parece limitarse únicamente a una estricta relación precio-calidad, no menos verdad es que, en mi opinión, la calidez con la que fuimos recibidos reflejó cómo hubiera sido el trato de haber decidido cenar ahí mismo.
No dudo en valorar a este lugar con cinco estrellas.

Rewrite this for me:
During our vacation and without the desire to cook, we decided to order pizzas from this place for takeout and eat at the place where we were staying, which was 500 meters away. So, on a summer Thursday, we went to pick them up around 9:30 PM.
We entered and found it very pleasant, clean, and comfortable to eat there. We were attended by a very kind and attentive man.
We ordered the following flavors:
- prosciutto (raw ham);
- ham (cooked ham);
- pepperoni;
- onion;
- mushrooms;
- anchovies; and
- basil and tomato.
The pizzas took 25/30 minutes. All of their flavors - which I will share a photo of - were delicious. The pizza style was stone-fired, with tomato sauce and an ideal amount of mozzarella cheese.
Although this comment seems to be limited solely to a strict price-quality relationship, it is also true that, in my opinion, the warmth with which we were received reflected how the service would have been if we had decided to dine there. 
I have no doubt in giving this place a five-star rating.
